{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260moeLKpr1c1794475428.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今年首9個月，共有2,631人等候器官移植，醫管局呼籲市民登記器官捐贈。</p><p></p><p>醫管局指共有逾2,400人，輪候腎臟移植。其次是肝及心臟，分別有74及76人，等候肺部移植就有18人。</p><p></p><p>醫管局指現時有多種肺病，如慢性阻塞性肺病、肺纖維肺病等，沒藥物可根治，需接受肺部移植。但本港可供移植的肺部數量很少，加上手術難度高，或出現衰竭等風險。形容每個移植機會都很珍貴，期望市民能登記器官捐贈，幫助有需要病人。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.917141+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:18:14.408928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.649072+00:00","content_hash":"add14134132252253e43bac8cd239fce4e420a31b3fa1cebb344f73432e3b0c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.917141+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}